- about 7 are call-free: a match extracting scalars, or an `is` test;
- about 9 call a small projection method on the view (`text_of`, `body_of`, `elems_of`, `surface`), so they need the callee proven not to write any cell;
- about 9 are match sites whose arms keep a box payload live into calls.

That shapes the design; I'll post it with the census share once the by-kind numbers land.

